Package: wwvsim
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: WWV/WWVH emulator
 Generates complete WWV or WWVH audio program: audio tones, second ticks, UT1 offset, minute beeps, 100 Hz timecode,
 half-hourly announcements but NOT minute announcements, which currently use a local speech synthesizer
 Includes Hamsci test signal at :08 on WWV, :48 on WWVH
 Support for special announcements
